# Copy to ".env" for local dev.
#
# Leave VITE_API_URL unset in development. The client calls relative /api URLs
# and the Vite dev server proxies /api to the API on http://localhost:3000
# (vite.config.ts). The API sends no CORS headers, so pointing the browser at
# http://localhost:3000 directly makes every call cross-origin and they fail.
# VITE_API_URL=
